id: SC-SEC-013
title: Obfuscated build system payload pattern (CVE-2024-3094 XZ)
category: security
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: Makefile Makefile.am configure.ac CMakeLists.txt
  exclude_paths: .git/ node_modules/
patterns:
  - regex: (?:sed|tr|head|tail).*\|.*(?:eval|sh|bash)
    message: "Build script piping through text tools into eval/sh — matches XZ backdoor pattern (CVE-2024-3094 CVSS 10.0)"
  - regex: test.*\|.*(?:xz|gzip|bzip2).*\|.*(?:eval|sh)
    message: "Test data piped through compression into shell execution — XZ backdoor pattern"
fix: Build scripts should not extract and execute binary data from test fixtures. Review any sed|eval chains carefully.